    "name": "P Total Demand",
    "why": "Total active power demand, W"
   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "BACnet/IP Enable defaults to No; set it, the UDP port (47808) and the device ID (default 26001) under Setup > Advanced, then reboot.",
   "Front panel password defaults to 000001; web login defaults to operator / abcd1234-.",
   "Foreign device registration (BBMD IP, port 47808, TTL 25145 s) is in the advanced settings.",
   "Optional password protection for ReinitializeDevice and DeviceCommunicationControl uses the fixed password abcd1234-."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "New BACnet/IP settings only take effect after a reboot.",
   "Writing 0xFF00 to AV 16 clears all energy registers."
  ]
 },
